Computer Use
------------
Package: @zavora-ai/computer-use-mcp 7.4.0
https://github.com/zavora-ai/computer-use-mcp
License: MIT; retained in node_modules/@zavora-ai/computer-use-mcp/LICENSE.
PetPal uses the fixed stdio server and the native module for the execution host.
The upstream Linux binaries require glibc 2.39. PetPal ships Ubuntu 22.04-compatible
x64 and ARM64 rebuilds from the fixed 7.4.0 source with one Linux X11 window
geometry/title correction. The exact patch, MIT license, build provenance and
native hashes are retained under server/native/computer-use/. ARM64 desktop
operation has not been physically tested.
The upstream package's Model Context Protocol 2.0.0 and Zod dependencies retain
their package licenses. PetPal is an independent integration.

